==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~23.33 seconds<sup>300f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 23.33~36.67 seconds<sup>700f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Gary Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Being the first stage in the event, this stage can be beaten just by spamming [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cats]].

==Trivia==
*Kids at School's Japanese name, Gakudō no Susume (学童のすゝめ, "An Encouragement of Schoolchildren"), is a reference to the book ''Gakumon no Susume'' (学問のすすめ, "An Encouragement of Learning") by [[wikipedia:Fukuzawa Yukichi|Fukuzawa Yukichi]].

